          "jcr:created": "Wed Apr 17 2024 21:15:15 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">By combining streamlined and dependable instrumentation with an array of anatomically aligned screw trajectories and an internal compression mechanism, the </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Valor Hindfoot Fusion Nail System</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"> is designed to simplify the arthrodesis procedure while providing a successful fusion.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The implants of the Valor Hindfoot Fusion Nail System combine the benefits of multiplanar anatomical screw trajectories with an internal compression mechanism to provide a comprehensive solution to fusion procedures of the tibiotalocalcaneal joints.</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 02 2024 18:15:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
